title: 12 - LFOs

cover_description: Beige pyramids in a row, extending off into the distance, on a black background. A dark blue sphere looms above.

cover: cover.jpg

-- synopsis
Strudel piece that makes strong use of Low Frequency Oscillators (LFOs)

