--more
At this point, I gave up on actual titles, and stuck with just describing the thing I focused on the most in the piece.
This one I prepped by going through Glossing's "You can modulate everything" tutorial,
which really did help, the reference isn't as useful for those functions because they're so different from the rest of strudel.
